### =====================================================================
### Identity Service API — identity-service
### Team Rocket — Joshua Larez
### Base: http://localhost:8081
### Run these IN ORDER: register → login → use JWT in core-monolith
### =====================================================================

@identityUrl = http://localhost:8081
@coreUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 1 — Health checks (both services)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Identity health
GET {{identityUrl}}/actuator/health

###

### 1b. Core-monolith health
GET {{coreUrl}}/actuator/health

###

### 1c. JWKS endpoint — should return RSA public key
GET {{identityUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 2 — Register a new account
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2. Register — copy the returned accountId for later
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-register-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl",
  "password": "Welkom123!",
  "displayName": "Joshua Larez"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 3 — Login and get JWT
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. Login — copy the accessToken from the response, paste it below as @token
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-login-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl",
  "password": "Welkom123!"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 4 — Use JWT to call core-monolith
### Paste the accessToken from the login response below
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@userId = PASTE_ACCOUNT_ID_HERE

### 4a. Get profile (auto-created when account registered via RabbitMQ event)
GET {{coreUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-jwt-profile-001

###

### 4b. Get notification prefs with JWT
GET {{coreUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/notification-prefs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: test-jwt-prefs-001

###

### 4c. Update profile with JWT
PUT {{coreUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-jwt-update-001

{
  "displayName": "Joshua Larez",
  "bio": "Software engineer. Team Rocket. Event Planner project.",
  "preferences": {
    "language": "nl",
    "timezone": "Europe/Amsterdam",
    "notificationChannel": "EMAIL"
  }
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 5 — Other Identity endpoints
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5. Request password reset
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-reset-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl"
}

###

### 6. Resend verification email
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-resend-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 6 — Validation errors (expected 4xx)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. Register duplicate email → expect 409
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-duplicate-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl",
  "password": "Welkom123!",
  "displayName": "Joshua Larez"
}

###

### 8. Login wrong password → expect 401
POST {{identityUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-wrong-pass-001

{
  "email": "joshua@teamrocket.nl",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

###

### 9. Call core-monolith without JWT → expect 401
GET {{coreUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
X-Correlation-Id: test-no-jwt-001

###

### 10. Call core-monolith with fake JWT → expect 401
GET {{coreUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9.fake.signature
X-Correlation-Id: test-fake-jwt-001

###
